{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Flowers are a category that includes several ",["l","农作物","crops"]," grown on the farm. In addition, two ",["l","采集","foraged"]," plants, ",["l","番红花","Crocus"]," and ",["l","甜豌豆","Sweet Pea"],"s, are considered to be flowers. Other foraged items that are real-life flowers (e.g., ",["l","蒲公英","Dandelion"],"s and ",["l","黄水仙","Daffodil"],"s) are categorized as ",["l","采集","Forage"]," instead of Flower and therefore are not included here."]],["p",["All flowers share several in-game characteristics:"]],["l",0,[[1,["Their sell prices are increased by 10% if the player has the ",["l","技能","Tiller"]," profession (even foraged Crocus and Sweet Pea)."]],[1,["Flowers grown as crops (i.e., other than Crocus and Sweet Pea) will affect the type of ",["l","蜂蜜","Honey"]," produced by nearby ",["l","蜂房","Bee House"],"s."]],[1,["Flowers (other than ",["l","虞美人花","Poppy"],") are a ",["l","友谊","universally liked gift"],"; all villagers other than ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", and ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"]," like them. Gifting foraged flowers can be an inexpensive way to level up ",["l","友谊","friendship"],"."]],[1,["Flowers (combined with ",["l","采集","Forage"]," and ",["l","树液采集器","Tree Sap"],") are one category used when scoring items in the ",["l","星露谷展览会","Grange Display"]," at the ",["l","星露谷展览会","Stardew Valley Fair"],"."]],[1,["They can be sold at the ",["l","皮埃尔的杂货店","General Store"]," (as well as in the ",["l","售卖","Shipping Bin"],")."]],[1,["All shipped flowers are added to the ",["l","收集品","Items Shipped"]," page of the Collections tab."]]]],["p",["The following tables lists all flowers, where to obtain them, how much they sell for, and the prices of the ",["l","蜂蜜","Honey"]," produced by nearby ",["l","蜂房","Bee House"],"s."]],["t",[[{"r":2,"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"r":2,"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"r":2,"h":1,"v":["Source"]},{"r":2,"h":1,"v":["Season"]},{"r":2,"h":1,"v":["Restores"]},{"c":2,"h":1,"v":["Sell Price"]},{"c":2,"h":1,"v":[["l","蜂蜜","Honey"]," Sell Price"]}],[{"h":1,"v":["Base"]},{"h":1,"v":[["l","技能","Tiller"]," (+10%)"]},{"h":1,"v":["Base"]},{"h":1,"v":[["l","技能","Artisan"]," (+40%)"]}],[[],[["l","甜豌豆","Sweet Pea"]],[["l","采集","Foraging"],"\n",["l","耕种","Farming"]," - ",["l","打造","Wild Seeds"]],["Summer"],["Inedible"],["50g"],["50g"],["N/A"],["N/A"]],[[],[["l","番红花","Crocus"]],[["l","采集","Foraging"],"\n",["l","耕种","Farming"]," - ",["l","打造","Wild Seeds"]],["Winter"],["Inedible"],["60g"],["60g"],["N/A"],["N/A"]],[[],[["l","郁金香","Tulip"]],[["l","耕种","Farming"]],["Spring"],["Energy 45\nHealth 20"],["30g"],["30g"],["30g"],["30g"]],[[],[["l","蓝爵","Blue Jazz"]],[["l","耕种","Farming"]],["Spring"],["Energy 45\nHealth 20"],["50g"],["50g"],["50g"],["50g"]],[[],[["l","夏季亮片","Summer Spangle"]],[["l","耕种","Farming"]],["Summer"],["Energy 45\nHealth 20"],["90g"],["90g"],["90g"],["90g"]],[[],[["l","虞美人花","Poppy"]],[["l","耕种","Farming"]],["Summer"],["Energy 45\nHealth 20"],["140g"],["140g"],["140g"],["140g"]],[[],[["l","向日葵","Sunflower"]],[["l","耕种","Farming"]],["Summer\nFall"],["Energy 45\nHealth 20"],["80g"],["80g"],["80g"],["80g"]],[[],[["l","玫瑰仙子","Fairy Rose"]],[["l","耕种","Farming"]],["Fall"],["Energy 45\nHealth 20"],["290g"],["290g"],["290g"],["290g"]]]]]]]}